come to a launch event so that I

00:24:22.340 --> 00:24:26.210
can interview them. And I sent
them all the same message on

00:24:26.210 --> 00:24:30.320
Facebook because I was, frankly,
a bit lazy, and I just changed

00:24:30.320 --> 00:24:34.340
